/target/

# Local reference data. Anything derived from a Bohemia/DayZ installation
# (catalogs, extracted files, RPT captures in progress) stays out of git.
# See docs/assets/provenance.md.
/reference/
/reference-data/
/local/

# Proprietary container/asset formats must never be committed.
# The repository guard test (crates/assets/tests/repository_guard.rs)
# enforces this by content as well as by extension. Patterns are written
# case-insensitively because git matches case-sensitively on Linux and
# nothing guarantees lower-case extensions in a game or mod installation.
*.[pP][bB][oO]
*.[eE][bB][oO]
*.[pP][aA][aA]
*.[pP][aA][cC]
*.[pP]3[dD]
*.[wW][rR][pP]
*.[rR][tT][mM]
*.[wW][sS][sS]
*.[bB][iI][sS][iI][gG][nN]
*.[bB][iI][kK][eE][yY]
*.[rR][pP][tT]
